Z||000000||mrgone||06-10-2001||04:21 PM||||i want to check the level of my manual tranny fluid but i dont want to break off the fluid level/speedo thingy. what do i use to get it off? <P>i bought 'semi-synthetic extreme pressure gear oil' from canadian tire. it was 4x the cost of the automatic tranny fluid (dextron 3) which says on the jug for automatic transmissions         is this ok?||||reg||5
